["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Episode #251 ... You Must Change Your Life, Pt. 2 - The Worlds That Make Us co-immunity symbolic immunity vertical tension base camp anthrotechnics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-08-philosophize-改变人生不是换信念-而是移动你的大本营/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e87b1cc15318e66e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">35:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophize This!</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0808</span></div>\n<h2>改变人生不是换信念，而是搬出你亲手搭的赌场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人不是站在世界对面的独立主体，而是被环境、身体和符号免疫系统共同构成的产物；想改变人生，就要同时改信念、行动与世界，而不是只逼自己「想通」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">斯洛特戴克</span><span class=\"tag\">环境塑造</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"505 – The Battle of Tinchebray Orderic Vitalis Henry of Huntingdon siege castle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-britishhist-亨利一世在坦什布赖靠下马步战加伏兵生擒长兄/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>下马步战加伏兵：亨利一世生擒亲哥的诺曼底决战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利一世让骑士下马步战，再用隐蔽的第四梯队侧翼伏击，生擒哥哥罗伯特，终结这场诺曼底争夺战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪史</span><span class=\"tag\">诺曼底</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Briefing Chat: Is DNA repair the secret to a long life? Whales and mole-rats offer tantalizing hints dormant virus double-strand break CIRBP (cold-inducible RNA-binding protein) Sirt6 Fucoidan NAD+\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-naturepod-长新冠或源于休眠病毒-dna修复或为长寿关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/15a972da91ae970c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">13:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>DNA修复才是长寿关键：弓头鲸的修复蛋白已进入人体试验</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究显示近半数新冠住院患者体内潜伏病毒被再激活，一年后炎症和细胞损伤更高；而弓头鲸等长寿动物的共同点不是抑癌基因，而是更强的DNA修复能力，相关药物已进入人体试验。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">长新冠</span><span class=\"tag\">潜伏病毒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Out of Ammo for Real + Are CCAs Dumb? CCA (Collaborative Combat Aircraft) AUKUS standoff munitions porcupine strategy man-unmanned teaming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-chinatalk-美伊战争打光了打中国的弹药-日本开始准备独自扛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4db31a40ea9a2794-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>美伊战争打光了打中国的弹药，日本开始准备独自扛</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国把为对华战争储备的远程弹药几乎全打在了伊朗，中东基地准备放弃，日本因此改写防卫战略、准备先自己扛一段时间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防</span><span class=\"tag\">弹药库存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to Disagree With Your Kids Without Fighting HEAR framework curiosity sandwich false polarization hedging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-raisinggh-别只让孩子换位思考-要让他看见你在听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/41f3114355314dc3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">55:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>别教孩子共情，先让他看见你在听</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">让孩子学会好好分歧，关键不是教共情或换位思考，而是用语言证明你在听；HEAR 框架和好奇三明治可以立刻用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子沟通</span><span class=\"tag\">分歧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What does a parent owe their child? PGT-A polygenic testing pleiotropy satisficing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-grayarea-胚胎筛选-父母该为孩子做到哪一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77b28234367aefc8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>筛选胚胎不是尽一切可能，是道德绑架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基因筛选能降低疾病风险，但统计意义常被夸大，且可能加剧社会不平等。父母应追求「足够好」而非「最优」，警惕商业公司的道德绑架。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基因筛选</span><span class=\"tag\">生育伦理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Weight of Fame: A Hollywood Tragedy lipectomy fen-phen primary pulmonary hypertension (PPH)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-cautionary-制片厂的合同里写着-女演员的身体不得改变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>女演员合同锁死体重：增重即违约，减肥即送命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1920 年代女演员 Molly 因体重增加被片方雪藏、走上手术台；1990 年代新娘 Mary 因减肥药芬芬丧命。当身体成为商业资产，惩罚与捷径都通向同一个结局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">好莱坞</span><span class=\"tag\">身体标准</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why did AMD just buy this REALLY WEIRD chip company? SRAM reticle size agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-techtechpotato-amd收购talus-押注模型定制芯片的未来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d473494a95916b2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>AMD收购Talus：把AI模型烧进芯片，每秒跑1.7万token</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AMD收购了Talus，一家为特定AI模型定制芯片、实现每秒17,000 tokens的初创公司。这标志着AI推理走向非可编程、模型专用芯片的方向。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">AMD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How “Forgive and Forget” Buried a Church’s Dark Secret OALC mandated reporter forgive and forget\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-papertrail-教会用-原谅与遗忘-处理性侵-受害者被要求闭嘴/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/031f7ffec8b5b0e0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">45:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>教会用「原谅与遗忘」处理性侵，受害者被要求闭嘴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">明尼苏达州一个封闭教派把「原谅与遗忘」写进官方指引，让性侵在内部消化、不进司法程序。一名检察官把案子交给记者，才挖出跨三代的系统性掩盖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教机构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The FCC&#x27;s New Robot Rules covered list conditional approval blue UAS list bad labs onshoring plan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-chinatalk-fcc-用一份笨规则-把中国机器人挡在门外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a805ef1f2e186f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>FCC 用一份笨规则，把中国机器人挡在门外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FCC 把移动机器人列入 covered list，新机型一律不能进口。理由不是技术多先进，而是供应链依赖越晚解决越难，所以宁可要简单粗暴的规则，也不要精雕细琢的豁免。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"贾扬清：我所经历的「人工智能已死」到「AI 颠覆世界」的数年巨变丨串台「声东击西」S10E24 Caffe AlexNet Agent FAIR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-whatsnext-单个智能体再强也成不了团队-ai需要生产关系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">2:10:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>AI没杀死工作，Agent团队才是真瓶颈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">贾扬清从Caffe到两次创业，复盘AI十五年：模型能力已经够用，瓶颈在怎么让一群Agent像人类团队一样协作，他还断言AI没带来大规模裁员，只是替罪羊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chasing Trillion-Dollar Companies, Founder Ambition, Token Budgets, and Regulatory Capture with Sarah &amp; Elad punctuated equilibrium RSI ROIT regulatory capture exit tax\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-nopriors-三位万亿公司五年内出现-但下一个不会这么快/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d8446c4650e10d7e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">39:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>三位万亿公司五年内出现，但下一个不会这么快</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五年内三家从零到万亿美元市值是历史异常，不是新常态。真正稀缺的不是大市场，而是能在五年内跑到 500 亿美元收入的速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">创始人退出</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Barry Ritholtz: How Not to Invest | Rational Reminder 421 halo effect Gell-Mann amnesia Sturgeon&#x27;s Law decumulation ESOP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-rationalreminder-亿万富翁的经济预测-和短视频里的理财建议一样不可信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d88279cd5f22a944-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>亿万富翁的经济预测，和短视频里的理财建议一样不可信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光环效应让人把成功者的所有话当洞见，但他们在自己领域之外同样一无所知；好建议谦卑且概率化，坏建议自信且具体。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>14</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投资</span><span class=\"tag\">行为金融</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Weight Loss: Why Won&#x27;t It Stick? weight cycling visceral fat macrophage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-sciencevs-体重循环不毁代谢-健康行为比体重重要/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>溜溜球节食不毁代谢，健康习惯比体重更决定寿命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">体重循环（溜溜球节食）不会永久破坏代谢，普通人的反弹增重很少造成肌肉流失；真正影响健康和寿命的是健康习惯本身，不是体重的上下波动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体重循环</span><span class=\"tag\">减肥</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Brad Setser on the US&#x27;s Unusual Japanese Yen Intervention FIMA Repo Facility ESF Primary Balance Carry Trade Big Mac Index\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-oddlots-美国为何联手日本干预日元-新工具与旧逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">42:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>美国联手日本干预日元：卖欧元而非美元，赌日本央行加息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国财政部罕见联手日本干预日元，卖出欧元而非美元，并动用 FEMA 回购工具。Brad Setser 认为，只要日本央行加息，干预就能奏效，且日本财政状况远好于美国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日元</span><span class=\"tag\">外汇干预</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The economics of putting germicidal light in every room, with Misha Gurevich and Vivian Belenky of Aerolamp far UVC krypton chloride excimer lamp ASHRAE 241 R0 hygiene hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-complexsys-222纳米杀菌灯便宜有效-缺的是认知而非技术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fc764da6acb74e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>222纳米灯杀菌有效却一年只卖几百台，瓶颈不是技术</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Far UVC 用 222 纳米光在空气中灭活病原体，对人体表层无害；南非 TB 试验已看到 90% 抑制，但全世界一年只卖几百台。真正瓶颈是认知扩散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">far UVC</span><span class=\"tag\">空气传播疾病</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Julia Ioffe on Russian Women, Missing Men, and the Roots of Autocracy woman question single sex family gender essentialism pronatalist policy steam valve\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-05-tyler-苏联把女人炼成超人-把男人宠成废物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3096d9c0d3a4a23d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">55:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0805</span></div>\n<h2>苏联把女人炼成超人，把男人宠成废物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二战后2700万苏联人丧生，男人成了稀缺资源；国家用堕胎禁令、婚外生育奖励和家暴非刑化把女人锻成超人，把男人宠成废物，这套秩序至今支撑普京的父权动员。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄国社会</span><span class=\"tag\">性别政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E247｜对话盛颖：xAI，Infra的浪漫，SGLang，开源，平权与“甄嬛传” SGLang RadixAttention KVCache Miles day zero one year cliff\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-05-sv101-xai-最美好的时代-为什么留不住她/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0805</span></div>\n<h2>xAI 最美好的时代，为什么留不住她</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">盛颖把 xAI 早期称为 v1.0：不到 100 人、没有 politics、同时给她 support 和 freedom。她为了 SGLang 社区提前两个月离开，放弃一年 cliff 的 vesting。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Infra</span><span class=\"tag\">开源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"美国无人驾驶20年兴衰：天才、小偷、叛徒，从沙漠到法庭的大冒险 DARPA L3 激光雷达 founder mode\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-cnf65bb3-自动驾驶真正的难关不是技术-是最后那-5-的意外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac2c4de6938cb713-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技这碗饭</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>自动驾驶真正的难关不是技术，是最后那 5% 的意外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1995 年一辆奔驰就自动跑完了 1758 公里高速，95% 的里程机器早就会开；可只要剩下 5% 的意外还在，驾驶座上就必须留一个人，司机的工资一分钱都省不下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">DARPA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Big Tech&#x27;s Hidden Debt Problem off-balance-sheet vehicle vendor financing big market delusion incomplete revelation hypothesis limits of arbitrage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-patrickboyle-表外债务不是欺诈-真正的风险是没人读脚注/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">32:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头表外债务不是欺诈，是没人读脚注</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓 1.65 万亿美元隐藏债务并不是 Enron 式欺诈，而是未投运数据中心的长租与采购承诺，合法但埋在脚注里；真正危险的是 AI 巨头靠互相融资和调整后收益讲故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 资本开支</span><span class=\"tag\">表外债务</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What the hell happened with AGI timelines in 2026? – Rob Wiblin RLVR METR ECI GDPval Vending-Bench 2 AI Village\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-eightythousand-agi-时间线提前一年-但脏活仍是瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a7038cb60f3d75b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">49:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>AI 收入年增 700%，但脏活任务仍差人类 6 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年 AI 进展证据：收入爆炸、编码智能体成熟，但脏活任务仍差；时间线缩短约一年，但长期仍存变数。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"283: ENCORE: Best of Ask Lisa: Friendship Breakups &amp; Conflict relational aggression queen bee blame the parent two-faced\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-asklisa-友谊破裂是成长章节-不是人生判决/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>被朋友群踢出不是判决：那是化学键在加固</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子被朋友群排挤，或要主动结束一段友谊，都是青春期的正常章节；家长最该做的是给孩子视角和具体话术，而不是代替他冲进去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">友谊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"178: Ubiquiti least privilege VPN kill switch MAC address\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-darknetdiaries-ubiquiti-内鬼自导自演勒索比特币-败在自家路由器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e2627fbdeaef9327-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">36:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Darknet Diaries</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>年薪 25 万美元仍嫌少，他自导自演勒索自家公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ubiquiti 云团队负责人觉得年薪 25 万美元还不够，自导自演入侵公司、索要 25 比特币，结果被自家路由器记录的 MAC 地址锁定，判刑六年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内鬼攻击</span><span class=\"tag\">企业勒索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Inference Engineering Masterclass — Philip Kiely &amp; Ali Taha, Baseten speculative decoding (spec dec) PD disaggregation NVFP4 mega kernel expert parallelism KV cache compaction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-latentspace-量化更多层反而更准-因为误差会互相抵消/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23103bc773bd5837-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>量化更多层反而更准：误差会互相抵消</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">选对层之后，量化更多反而更保真——误差会互相抵消；同理 10 倍加速不是单点突破，而是量化、speculator、PD 分离各翻一倍叠出来的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理优化</span><span class=\"tag\">量化</span>\n</div></div></a>"]